WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.062 --> 00:00:05.257
- [Heavy breathing]
- [Growling]

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:09.234
MICHAEL GIACCHINO
Cut! That was pretty good.

00:00:09.391 --> 00:00:11.035
♪♪

00:00:11.086 --> 00:00:12.210
KEVIN FEIGE
You may know Michael

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.296
as an amazing composer.

00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:20.458
But he also is a very
talented director.

00:00:22.029 --> 00:00:23.197
MICHAEL GIACCHINO
Werewolf by Night.

00:00:23.247 --> 00:00:26.501
This is something I've been wanting
to make since I was making movies

00:00:26.552 --> 00:00:27.443
when I was a kid.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:31.443
Hopefully it goes as smoothly as
those old Super 8 movies.

00:00:32.997 --> 00:00:35.279
ANTHONY GIACCHINO
Mom, he's gonna be directing for Marvel.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.818
Michael's wanted to do this
since he was a kid.

00:00:39.457 --> 00:00:41.739
MICHAEL GIACCHINO
Directing this movie, it's really just

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.876
an extension of what I've always done.

00:00:46.172 --> 00:00:49.656
To be able to make a Marvel
monster movie, I am so lucky.

00:00:51.531 --> 00:00:53.856
[Laughing]

00:00:53.906 --> 00:00:54.895
[Growl]

00:00:54.946 --> 00:00:56.343
[Scream]

00:00:59.593 --> 00:01:01.140
MICHAEL GIACCHINO
This is my life right now.

00:01:05.169 --> 00:01:08.617
(A behind the scenes look at
Werewolf by Night.)

00:01:09.031 --> 00:01:10.230
JOSEPHINE GIACCHINO
MCU?

00:01:10.281 --> 00:01:12.046
ANTHONY GIACCHINO
Marvel Cinematic Universe.

00:01:12.097 --> 00:01:15.226
JOSEPHINE GIACCHINO
Oh. Okay.

